# src/domain/

The innermost layer of the Onion Architecture. Contains pure business logic
with zero framework or infrastructure knowledge.

- `entities/` — domain entities (plain TypeScript classes)
- `services/` — domain services (pure business rules operating on entities)
- `repositories/` — repository interfaces (pure abstractions, no DI tokens)

**Rule:** Nothing in `domain/` imports from `application/`, `infrastructure/`,
or any NestJS/HTTP/database library.
